From 7dae8198ef2133b30fadc1f2ac312031dab3d2ee Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Teguh Sobirin <teguh@sobir.in>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 22:37:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 45/71] wifi: ath12k: allow receive-only services in
 map_service_to_pipe

WMI_CONTROL_DIAG is mapped PIPEDIR_IN only on WCN7750; the host never
sends on it. Requiring both directions fails the service after the HTC
endpoint has already been installed. Use the receive pipe for both.

Signed-off-by: Teguh Sobirin <teguh@sobir.in>
---
 drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/pci.c | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/pci.c b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/pci.c
index 07a1052aa..6fc387a12 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/pci.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/ath/ath12k/pci.c
@@ -999,7 +999,10 @@ int ath12k_pci_map_service_to_pipe(struct ath12k_base *ab, u16 service_id,
 		}
 	}
 
-	if (WARN_ON(!ul_set || !dl_set))
+	/* receive-only service (WMI_CONTROL_DIAG) */
+	if (dl_set && !ul_set)
+		*ul_pipe = *dl_pipe;
+	else if (WARN_ON(!ul_set || !dl_set))
 		return -ENOENT;
 
 	return 0;
-- 
